#. module: partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk_related_parties
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk_related_parties/models/res_partner.py:0
msgid ""
"ORSF gates the ownership graph behind a signed-in session, and issues no API key for it.\n"
"\n"
"Set an ORSF account e-mail and password in Settings ▸ Contacts ▸ ORSF; the session is then obtained and refreshed automatically.\n"
"\n"
"If they are already set, the sign-in was refused — check them, and the server log for the reason."
msgstr ""
"ORSF sprístupňuje graf vlastníckych vzťahov len po prihlásení a nevydáva naň"
" API kľúč. Zadajte e-mail a heslo konta ORSF v Nastavenia ▸ Kontakty ▸ ORSF;"
" relácia sa potom získa a obnovuje automaticky. Ak sú už zadané, prihlásenie"
" bolo odmietnuté — skontrolujte ich a dôvod nájdete v protokole servera."

#. module: partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk_related_parties
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk_related_parties/models/res_partner.py:0
msgid ""
"ORSF returned no graph for IČO %s. The session token may have expired, or "
"the rate limit was reached — the server log has the detail."
msgstr ""
"ORSF nevrátil graf pre IČO %s. Mohla vypršať platnosť relácie alebo sa "
"dosiahol limit požiadaviek — podrobnosti sú v protokole servera."

#. module: partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk_related_parties
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk_related_parties.view_partner_form_orsf_sk_related_parties
msgid ""
"One partner at a time — ORSF gates the ownership graph and\n"
"                        asks callers not to bulk-fetch persons (GDPR Art. 6(1)(f)).\n"
"                        A shared officer is a lead, not a finding: the § 2 písm. n)\n"
"                        test is wider than the register."
msgstr ""
"Vždy len jeden partner — ORSF chráni graf vlastníckych vzťahov a žiada, aby "
"sa osoby nesťahovali hromadne (čl. 6 ods. 1 písm. f) GDPR). Spoločný konateľ"
" je indícia, nie záver: test podľa § 2 písm. n) je širší než register."

